  <para style="h">Beduru Huaisan Ji 1 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Beduru Huaisan Ji 1 Hui Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Beduru</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Bed</para>
  <para style="mt">Beduru Huaisan Ji 1 Hui Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihade shitu danlasan <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="png">Bendu</char>, <char style="png">Jialatai</char>, <char style="png">Jiapadojia</char>, <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>, <char style="png">Bituini</char>de sandazhi zhanshi jiere souzhi Huda sunghusan kunlade xin huaizho. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Ada Huda tai eqighanse jinjidene Shenlinghala zhiguishigha <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai shunjighazhi hhei chusunghala xireighazhi ganjinraghawo. Huda tande nenjien, pinnan olon ogi gie!<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai ada Hudade doulaye! Hhe matande hende ubali xiidene <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai fugusan kun dundase aminne olughakughala matanyi erchan olughazhi zhenzhenji xiwon ogizho. <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Pse ulie xiuqiraku, ulie zannantuku, ulie widaku jiachanyi tande oluzhi asiman jiere sunjizho. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Huda ta xianxin giekui tungo giezhi nenlighalane tai baohu giedene duya barakude xienjizhi khizhene giesan jiuikui tande ogine. <verse eid="1PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Ingiese ta hende bayasuzho. Ta bixi zhanshi jiere yanyanji kunnande yuchou giezhoma, <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>enezighan kunnan tai xinyanshi zhenni bikui mejieghane. Khande tuliesan antanliuzhe huailunema, tai xinyan antanse da guizhunde <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha xienjikude tande kuaiku, fama, zhiguii ireghane. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Ta <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i chanlazhi ese daozhoma, hhende orezho. Edeliuzhe hhei chanla danema, hhei xianxin giezhi kielienghala kielie daku, hashu witu bayasukughala bayasuzho. <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>Ta xinyanni jiegoi jienliezho. Hheshi goyane jiuiku wo.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Ene jiuikui kieliese xienzhila xianxide chaizhi yenjiu giezhi daozho. Tande ogine giesan ene nenjienni hhela melie kieliezhi daozho. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Hhela Mexihashi kien bikui, yan xienzide irekui yenjiu giezho. Mexiha shouku giedene khuinashi fama irekui Mexihani ruhher hhelai sudoro melie kieliezho. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Hhela ene wiliei giese goyadene ese giezho, tande oluzhi giesei Huda hhelade mejieghazho. Ene gouxioxishi chonjichen kunla asiman jierese peizhi ireghasan Shenlinyi nenlighala ede tande chonjizhi ogiwo. Ene shiqinlai qienxienlaye hende uzheku duran wo.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zhiguide Udu Daoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Ingiese ta zhughedene zhunbei giezhi jinxin giedene <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha xienjikude tande deilazhi ireku nenjienyi goude panji. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Ta shunjiku kewosi danlazhi eqighanku mutun yama mejie dazhi nefuxin giekulai bu dagha. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Tai urusan Hudashi zhigui mutun taye yan shiqin giese zhiguide gie. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Jinwun jiere jilazhi kieliezho, "Bishi zhiguitu wo, taye zhiguishi."<verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Ta xiahua giekude kunni pienxin ulie giezhi kunni giekughala panjichen Ezhanni Ada giezhi uruse ta zhanshi jiere duyade bikude hhei zunjizhi udu dao. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Ta mejiene. Tai xienrenla tande chonjizhi ogisan yama zoin witu xigonse tai shuisanshi huailuku antan, miengughala pusho, <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>Mexihani zhiguitu chusunghala wo. Hoxian goujida uye chaizhi ese cheiqisan ghoni ghughanyi chusunyi xianli. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Huda Mexihai duya zhayaghaku melie jinjiwoma, duya barakude tande oluzhi xienjizhi khizheghawo. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Ta Mexihai tungo giezhi hhei fugusan kun dundase aminne olughazhi hhende kuaikui ogisan Hudai xianxin giezho. Ingiese ta xianxin giesan, panjisanne man Hudade kouizho.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Ta zhendaoi shunjizhi goyane ganjinraghazhi kunlade zhenzhenji orezho. Ingiese xiacha giezhi zhughesene nieniedene orendu. <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Tai erchan olusanshi huailuku fureghala pusho, ulie huailuku fureghala wo. Hudai chanqi ulie widaku, amitu kielienghala wo. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Jinwun jiere kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">"Kun osun niekielien wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">Kunni fama osun jieredu chizhe niekielien wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Osun ghone, chizheye xiniene.<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>Zinie Hudai kielien chanqi wine."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Ene kielienshi tande chonjisan gouxioxi wo.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Amitu Tashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Ingiese soyuji doghunni, piendaku, jiazhon gieku, dubilieku, sugieku enelai ta man widagha. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>Yeliwa neizii neiiku mutun taye qingiezhi zhenni, pse gou daolini neii. Ruhherni ganjin neizii neii. Daolide kouizhi izhi fugiedase jiuine. <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>Ta Ezhan gou bikui mejiese qingiezhi gie.<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Ta <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i shida ire. Hheshi amitu tashi wo. Kunla hhei bendawoma, Huda hhazeliezhi sunghuwo. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Taye amitu tashi mutun nienieji luizhi ruhhertu gie gholu. Ingie zhiguitu buwa danladene <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi Huda bayasuku mutun jiomuntu mure ogi. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Jinwun jiere kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">"Uzhe, bi zhiguide sunghusan tashii <char style="png">Xiwun</char>de teizhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">jichu tashi gholughawo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Hhei xianxin giesanla jiuren ulie giene."<verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Ingiese ene tashi xianxin giesan tande zhigui woma, ulie xianxin giesan kunlade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">"Jianrenla bendasan tashi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">giei zhunyo tashi gholuwo"<verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>pse</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">hheshi kunyi banjighaku tashi wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">Unaghaku fugie tashi wo giezho.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Hhela banjikushi kielienyi uye shunjizho. Eneshi hhelai amin wo.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Ingieliuzhe tashi sunghusan bexin, honshan mutun buwa, zhiguitu minzu, bexin wo. Tai kharanise uruzhi khizheghadene goyai ghudureqitu gonqi dunda ireghasan Hudai famatuni kunlade kielieghane giezho. <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Melieshida tashi bexin pusho. Ede Hudai bexin wo. Melieshida tande ubali ese xiizho. Ede ubali xiizho.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Mii orentula, tashi duyade zhanshi jiere sousan niman kun wo. Bi tande goude fenfulaye, ruhherghala eghinduku beyeni nefuxinni bu gie. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Ta niman kunlai dunda goude gie. Ingiese ta doghunni giezho giezhi sugiesan kunla ta goude giesei uzhedene Huda panjiku udude hhei kuaine.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Qienli Bareisan Kunlai Shunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Ta Ezhanyi yenyinghala soyuji kunni zhiduni shunji. Zui fugie qienlitu honshan, <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>pse noyenlai shunji. Noyenlashi doghunni giesan kunlai faizhi gounii giesan kunlai kuaighane giezhi honshan peisan wo. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Hudai isishi ta gouni giezhi bende yama ulie mejiechen kunlai amanyi duigha giezho. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Tashi ziyutui woma, ziyughala doghunni gieku jiekou bu gholughadene Hudai hoji mutun gie. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Jien kunlai zunzhun gie. Xianxin giesan kunlade ore. Hudai zunji. Honshanyi zunzhun gie.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexiha Shouku Giezhi Yanzi Uzheghazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Hoji danlasan kunla, ta zunzhun gieku zhugheghala ezhanne shunji. Zinie gou, renyitui pusho, mouxiennilaiye shunji. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Kien hanhanji shouku giedene Hudai sumulazhi rennai giese kuaikui wine. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Zui fanjidene eghikui rennai giese yan kuaikui wine? Gouni giedene shouku giekui rennai giese Hudai melie kuaikui wine. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Shouku gieliuzhe gouni giekude Huda tai uruzho. Mexihaye tande oluzhi shouku giezhi yanzi uzheghawo. Tai goyane korolon mutun yoghane giezho.<verse eid="1PE 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>Hhe zui fanjizhi ese daozho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">ghudanye kieliezhi ese daozho.<verse eid="1PE 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Hhei sugiekude khareizhi ese sugiewo, shouku giekude ayighaku kielien ese kieliewo, khareidene goyane gundande panjichen Hudade jiuiwo. <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Hhe qinsi beyeghalane shizijia jiere mai zuini danjidene mai zui dunda udu ulie daoghazhi gounide udu daoghawo. Hhe shan deiladene ta goudawo. <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Ta eqighandei miisan ghoni niekielien wo. Ede ruhhertai adulachen, baohu giechen hhei shida khareizhi irewo.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Bierei Zhanguijighala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Biereila, taye qingiezhi zhanguijine shunji. Ingiese Hudai daolii ese xianxin giesan zhanguijiliuzhe ta kieliesanlai pusho, giesanlai uzhedene zhugheini gojiolughane. <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>Yenyinshi ta zunzhun giezhi ganjinde udu daosei hhela chanlawo. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Ta mienzide usunne bienjizhi antan zhozhi seighan jien musizhi bu dabala. <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Khareidene ta renyi, undantughala sudorone dabala. Eneshi ulie xiuqiraku seighanni wo, Hudai melie zhigui wo. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Hudai kouisan eqighanku zhiguitu biereilaye ingiezhi zhanguijine shunjizhi goyane dabalazho. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/><char style="pn">Sare</char> <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>i shunjizhi ezhan giezhi uruzho. Ta yama ulie ayidene gounii giese <char style="pn">Sare</char> mutun gholuwo.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Zhanguijila, taye qingiezhi biereighalane hhantu udu daokude hhelai gonxin gie. Hhelashi zholien oqitula wo. Hhelashi tanre hhantu aminni nenjienyi jienliechen wo giezhi zunzhun gie. Ingiese tai onxian giekui ulie duine.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gundannide Oluzhi Shouku Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Zuihoude kielieye, ta man nie zhughe gholuzhi nieniedene ubali xii, nieniedene ore, renyide giezhi goyane meilade uzhe. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Doghunnide doghunnii, sugiekude sugiekui bu kharuludene hhelade oluzhi gouni kielie. Huda tai zhen enende uruzhi fuqi jienlieghane giezho. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Jinwun jiere kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">Kien goude udu daoghane giezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">xianshou giene giese</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">Kielienne gonjizhi doghun kielien bu kielie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">Amanne gonjizhi ghudan bu kielie.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Doghunnise likai giezhi gouni gie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">heqishikui xiacha giezhi gie.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Ezhanni nudun gou kunyi uzhene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">hhei chighin hhela waradasei chenlienema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Doghunni giesan kunlade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Ezhan uxinne boughane.<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Ta goude gouni giese kien tai heine? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Ta gouni giedene shouku giese tande fuqi wine. Kunla ayighakuse bu ayi, ye bu jinda. <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Zhughedene Mexihai zunjizhi hhei ezhan danlagha. Kunla ta zhughedene panjisei asase suishisui huida giekui zhunbei gie. <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>Huida giekude renyide zunzhun giezhi gie. Ta lianxin bu ghudandu. Ingiese kunla tai uru giekude ta Mexihai xianxin giezhi giesan gounii sugiesan kunla shizhene. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Gouni giezhi shouku giekushi Hudai isi enbese doghunni giezhi shouku giekuse gou wo. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Mexihaye zuini yenyinzhe 1 huide duya ijiewo. Ingiezhi gou kun gou witu kunyi deilawo. Ingiekushi Hudai melie tai echighane giezho. Beyeghala kieliese hhe duya ijiewo, ruhherghala kieliese aminne oluwo. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Hhe echidene ruhherghalane bafanzide khasan ruhherlade daoli chonjizho. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>Hhelashi eqighandei <char style="pn">Nuhha</char> chon gieku shihoude Huda rennai giezhi sagheikude uye shunjisan kunla wo. Hhe shihoude chon jiere khizhi ususe jiuisan kun jian neiman wo. <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Ene usushi xilini melie mejieghasan jihao wo, ede <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani aminne olughakughala tai jiuine. Hheshi beye jieredu goujiani widaghakui pusho, ulie ghudanduku lianxinghala Hudade fayen giekui wo. <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> asiman jiere khireizhi Hudai borun miende wo, qienxien, qienlitu, nenlitula man hhende shunjizho.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s">Hudai Isi Mutun Udu Dao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Mexiha ingiezhi beyedene shouku giezhoma, taye imutu zhugheghala goyane ku shouikui zhunbei gie. Beyede shouku giesan kun zuise gonxi sirazho. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Ingiedene feiliesan udude kunni nefuxinyi pse ulie daghazhi Hudai isi mutun udu daone. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Ta daosandei niman kunla xiqi bikulai daghazhi hu gieku, nefuxin gieku, jiu ochizhi sudoku, lon naduzhi ochiku, nigiedalai beiizhi hanzhan gieghakui pse bu gie. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Ene shiqin jiere ta hhelare hhantu qingiezhi hashu witu lon ulie giekui hhela chanladene ghudurezhi tai sugiezho. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Jianlai hhela amitu kun, fugusan kunyi panjiku Ezhanyi melie zhan jiuine. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Ene yenyin jiere fugusan kunladeye gouxioxini chonjikushi beye miende hhelai kun mutun panjine giezhoma, ruhher miende Huda mutun amituraghane giezho.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Duya baraku ghujinlawo. Ingiese ta zhughesene xioxin giezhi jinxin giedene onxian gie. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Zui zhunyonishi nieniedene shixinde ore. Oreku olon zuini khazhi widaghane. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Ta bayasuku zhugheghala nieniene giedene goude jienlie. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Ta zhao Huda tande ogisan nenjien mutun nieniene ushilazhi Huda ogisan yanyanji nenjienni gou gonjia danla. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Jianjichenla indan Hudai kielienyi jianjikuni wo. Ushilachenla indan Huda ogisan lilianghala ushilakuni wo. Ingiese yan gieliuzhe <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai tungo giezhi Hudade kuaikui ireghane. Kuaiku, qienlini chanqi izhi hhende ogi. Amine.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mexihani Tujini Shouku Gieku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Mii orentula, shiiku khan mutun tai jiere irese goyade yama shiqin penjiwo giezhi ghudure wo giezhi bu jindadene <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Mexiha mutun hhere hhantu shouku giezho giezhi bayasundu. Ingiese Mexihai famatui khizheghakude ta hende bayasuzhi jiuline. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Mexihai yenyin jiere kunla tai sugiese tande fuqi wine. Famatu ruhher, yejiushi Hudai Ruhher tai jiere wo. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Tai dunda kienliuzhe kun alaku, ghulaku, doghun shiqin gieku, ulie gonjiku shiqinyi gonjikughala shouku bu gie. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Mexihani tuji danlazhi shouku giese bu shizhedene ene nierei yenyinzhe Hudai kuai. <verse eid="1PE 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Panjiku shihou kuzhewo. Hudai bexinse panjizhi qiine. Matanse kaishi giese gouxioxini ulie shunjisan kunlai jiego matui gholune? <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Pse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">"Gou kunyi jiuiku chijiashi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">xienlian witu kun, zuirenla matui gholune?"<verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Ingiese Hudai isi mutun shouku giesan kunla izhi gouni giezhi duyai zhayaghasan kekaotu Ezhande goyane ogikui wo.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s">Hudai Ghonilai Qiezhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Tai dunda zhanlao danlasan kunlade bi sughazhi kielieye. Biyeshi zhanlao wo, Mexiha shouku giekude ganzhen beizhi jianlai khizheku famade hhantu xianshou giechen kun wo. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Tai dundadu Hudai ghonilai qiezhe. Hudai isi mutun hhelai zhaogu gie. Mienqian bu giedene yenyizhe gie. Baerde oluzhi bu giedene bayasuzhi gie. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Tande ogisan ghonilai gofende bu gonjizhi gieku yanzi uzhegha. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Ingiese Zui Fugie Adulachen xienjikude ibeizi ulie qida oluku famatu maghalai tande ogine.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Nasuchighan kunla, taye qingiezhi zhanlaolai shunji. Ta man nieniedene oluzhi goyane meilade uzhekui wiqin danlaghazhi pixilie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">"Huda goyane undude uzhesan kunlai fandui giene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">Goyane meilade uzhesan kunlade nenjien ogine."<verse eid="1PE 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Ingiese ta Hudai nenlitu kha doura goyane boghonide uzhe. Shihou kuzhese hhe tai undudaghane. <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Ta munan giekulane man Hudade echigha, hhe tai gonjine. <verse eid="1PE 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Ta xioxin giezhi jinxin gie. Tai duitou Ibilisi onghonosan shizi mutun eneman hhemanji yozhi ijieku kun ereizho. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Ta xianxin giesan zhughene khiduzheghazhi hhei dui. Duyani gaijiula niekielienji shouku giesei ta mejiene. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Nenjien durusan Huda, Mexihai tungo giezhi tai uruzhi hhei chanqiku famade ireghasan hhe zhanshi jiere shouku giesan tai qinsi hulunshighazhi khiduzheghane, lilian ogizhi undanlaghane. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Qienlini chanqi izhi hhende ogi. Amine!<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuihou Asaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Bi <char style="pn">Seila</char>i tungo giezhi ene okho xinni tande huaiwo. Bi uzhese hheshi nie kekaotu gaijiu wo. Bi xin huaikushi eneshi Hudai zhenzhenji nenjien wo giezhi tande sughazhi kieliezhi ganzhen beine giezho. Ta ene nenjien jiere bei. <verse eid="1PE 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Tanre hhantu sunghusan <char style="png">Babilun</char>ni jiohui tande kielien asazho. Mii kewon <char style="pn">Make</char>ye kielien asazho. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Ta oreku zhugheghala nieniedene kielien asa. Mexihai miende bisan tande man pinnan ogi gie!<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
